Dialogue: 0,0:00:03.66,0:00:06.56,TL,,0,0,0,,做过世界第{\fs78}1{\fs68}的斯瓦泰克
Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.06,0:00:10.51,TL,,0,0,0,,偏偏有一个人 她一次都没赢过
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.11,0:00:19.01,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}And a reaction to match, Jelena Ostapenko!{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N赛点拿下 看奥斯塔彭科的反应！
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.36,0:00:20.83,TL,,0,0,0,,六战全胜
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.83,0:00:24.16,TL,,0,0,0,,武汉若会师决赛 便是第七次
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.76,0:00:27.95,TL,,0,0,0,,故事 要从{\fs78}2019{\fs68}年说起
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.36,0:00:29.51,TL,,0,0,0,,伯明翰草地
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.51,0:00:31.98,TL,,0,0,0,,{\fs78}18{\fs68}岁的资格赛选手斯瓦泰克
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.98,0:00:34.00,TL,,0,0,0,,遇上法网冠军
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.36,0:00:35.52,TL,,0,0,0,,首盘{\fs78}6{\fs68}比{\fs78}0{\fs68}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.52,0:00:39.09,TL,,0,0,0,,全场接发球{\fs78}38{\fs68}分拿下{\fs78}24{\fs68}分
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.36,0:00:41.60,TL,,0,0,0,,印第安维尔斯
Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.60,0:00:44.99,TL,,0,0,0,,{\fs78}2{\fs68}号种子斯瓦泰克两盘出局
Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.36,0:00:47.07,TL,,0,0,0,,迪拜 她先赢一盘
Dialogue: 0,0:00:47.07,0:00:49.49,TL,,0,0,0,,还是在抢七被逆转
Dialogue: 0,0:00:50.36,0:00:51.71,TL,,0,0,0,,{\fs78}2023{\fs68}年美网
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.71,0:00:55.57,TL,,0,0,0,,斯瓦泰克是卫冕冠军 也是世界第{\fs78}1{\fs68}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:56.16,0:00:57.83,TL,,0,0,0,,斯瓦泰克先赢一盘
Dialogue: 0,0:00:57.83,0:01:00.41,TL,,0,0,0,,奥斯塔彭科随即提速
Dialogue: 0,0:01:01.16,0:01:03.89,TL,,0,0,0,,奥斯塔彭科说 打得又快又狠
Dialogue: 0,0:01:03.89,0:01:06.10,TL,,0,0,0,,斯瓦泰克就有麻烦
Dialogue: 0,0:01:06.96,0:01:09.12,TL,,0,0,0,,决胜盘{\fs78}6{\fs68}比{\fs78}1{\fs68}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:12.71,0:01:20.71,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}Game, set, Jelena Ostapenko stuns number one.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N奥斯塔彭科爆冷击败世界第一！
Dialogue: 0,0:01:20.96,0:01:24.75,TL,,0,0,0,,连续{\fs78}75{\fs68}周的世界第{\fs78}1{\fs68} 到此为止
Dialogue: 0,0:01:25.36,0:01:26.76,TL,,0,0,0,,斯瓦泰克赛后说
Dialogue: 0,0:01:26.76,0:01:29.49,TL,,0,0,0,,突然间 我失去了控制
Dialogue: 0,0:01:30.16,0:01:33.42,TL,,0,0,0,,她的接发球得分率 {\fs78}52{\fs68}%
Dialogue: 0,0:01:34.36,0:01:35.80,TL,,0,0,0,,{\fs78}2025{\fs68}年多哈
Dialogue: 0,0:01:35.80,0:01:38.68,TL,,0,0,0,,{\fs78}3{\fs68}届卫冕冠军斯瓦泰克
Dialogue: 0,0:01:40.51,0:01:45.01,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}I'm just trying to think the last time Swiatek lost a match winning just four games.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N她上次只拿四局就输球 是何时？
Dialogue: 0,0:01:47.81,0:01:51.01,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}Does it again against Iga Swiatek.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N又一次击败斯瓦泰克
Dialogue: 0,0:01:51.16,0:01:55.46,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}She has the winning formula against Swiatek,{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N她有赢斯瓦泰克的公式
Dialogue: 0,0:01:55.56,0:01:59.91,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}as the three-time champion is brushed aside.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N三届冠军被扫地出局
Dialogue: 0,0:02:00.31,0:02:05.31,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}I was pretty confident that I obviously will beat her,{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N我很有信心 觉得自己肯定能赢她
Dialogue: 0,0:02:05.71,0:02:10.81,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}because we played a lot of matches and I kind of know how to play against her.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N我们交手很多次 我知道怎么打她
Dialogue: 0,0:02:11.06,0:02:12.84,TL,,0,0,0,,同年斯图加特红土
Dialogue: 0,0:02:12.84,0:02:15.21,TL,,0,0,0,,斯瓦泰克扳回一盘
Dialogue: 0,0:02:15.26,0:02:18.23,TL,,0,0,0,,决胜盘{\fs78}6{\fs68}比{\fs78}2{\fs68} 还是她
Dialogue: 0,0:02:19.61,0:02:24.01,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}It is a sensational six in a row{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N惊人的六连胜
Dialogue: 0,0:02:24.11,0:02:27.91,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}for Jelena Ostapenko against Iga Swiatek.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N奥斯塔彭科对斯瓦泰克！
Dialogue: 0,0:02:28.24,0:02:31.56,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}The second seed can hardly believe it.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N二号种子简直不敢相信
Dialogue: 0,0:02:31.81,0:02:35.72,TL,,0,0,0,,武汉这一周 两人只可能在决赛碰面
Dialogue: 0,0:02:37.06,0:02:43.56,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}And the final point goes Iga Swiatek's way.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N最后一分 属于斯瓦泰克
Dialogue: 0,0:02:43.81,0:02:46.81,TL,,0,0,0,,克星续写 还是破局？
